\* All TLC check configs for AntflyHARetentionReseed.tla, one section per check.
\* Sections are verbatim TLC config syntax; the build extracts them
\* (scripts/tla-cfg.sh). Section names match the make-target check ids.

==== positive
\* TLC config for AntflyHARetentionReseed.tla.

SPECIFICATION FairSpec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyTruncateIgnoresUnmarkedSlot = FALSE
    BuggyBackupEndIgnoresLostWal = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TypeOK
    TruncationCoversUnmarkedActiveSlots
    BackupEndFailsClosed
    Safety

PROPERTIES
    NoPermanentUnmarkedLag

==== BadBackupIgnoresLostWal
\* Expected-failure config: endBaseBackup skips retention validation and
\* reports success after its slot was lost or its WAL truncated. Pinned to
\* the fail-closed backup invariant.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyTruncateIgnoresUnmarkedSlot = FALSE
    BuggyBackupEndIgnoresLostWal = TRUE

INVARIANTS
    BackupEndFailsClosed

==== BadTruncateUnmarked
\* Expected-failure config: truncation uses a floor that assumes the
\* mark-reseed loop already ran, deleting WAL a still-unmarked lagging slot
\* needs. Pinned to the mark-before-truncate invariant.

SPECIFICATION Spec

CONSTANTS
    BuggyTruncateIgnoresUnmarkedSlot = TRUE
    BuggyBackupEndIgnoresLostWal = FALSE

INVARIANTS
    TruncationCoversUnmarkedActiveSlots
